# Captured output, stored verbatim.
#
# internal/dashboard/testdata/create-laravel.log is byte-for-byte what composer and
# artisan wrote on Windows — CRLF terminators included. Those terminators are part
# of what the log filter has to handle, so Git must not normalise them away: with
# core.autocrlf=input (this repository's setting on Windows) every CR disappeared
# from the committed blob, which silently weakened the test that reads it.
internal/dashboard/testdata/*.log -text
